    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Comfort and Warmth is a sweet and spicy visual novel meant to capture the feeling of a caring relationship. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the shoes of a woman in the early stages of a relationship with a man who's in it for the long haul. She might not have job security, benefits, or the respect of her bosses, but she does have a partner who'll support her through thick and thin. He'll lift her up when she's feeling down, and on her toughest days, he's always there to look after her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nameable protagonist.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choice-driven content, with player input not only over the flow of conversation, but explicit scenes. Determine the direction of the game's explicit content, or avoid it at will.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roughly one hour of content per playthrough.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hot chocolate for the soul.</p></li></ul>",
